ories</li>\n\t<li>Soft padded interior to cushion and keep your device safe</li>\n\t<li>Heavy duty zipper closure</li>\n\t<li>Reliable protection to use it alone or tuck it inside a backpack</li>\n\t<li>Available in different colors</li>\n</ul></div></div> <div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"specsTab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"specsTab___BV_tab_button__\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 m-auto specs\" style=\"display: none;\"><div id=\"specsContainer\" class=\"d-flex flex-wrap col-12 p-0\"><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Technical-specifications-grupo.png\" alt=\"Technical specifications\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTechnical specifications\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6> <hr> <div><ul>\n\t<li><strong>Fits laptops up to:&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>15.6in&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n\t<li><strong>Number of compartments:&nbsp;</strong>One main zippered pocket One front zippered pocket&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li><strong>Accessory pocket:&nbsp;</strong>Built-in handle on top&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li><strong>Handle Material:&nbsp;</strong>Outside: 100% polyester Inside: 100% polyester<strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Dimensions-grupo.png\" alt=\"Dimensions\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDimensions\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6> <hr> <div><ul>\n\t<li><strong>Exterior:&nbsp;</strong>14.5x9.4x0.7in <strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n\t<li><strong>Weight:&nbsp;</strong>0.6lb</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Additional-information-grupo.png\" alt=\"Additional information\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\